  <item>
    <title>【木星进入双子座特别辑】人人都有双子座：我的心稍微大于一整座宇宙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66530e3ac59d1e5757c1d4e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66530e3ac59d1e5757c1d4e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 10:26:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是“星星眼”的第三期——双子座，也是木星进入双子座的特别节目。我们将从神话图景、文学作品、文化名人，甚至是文化圈的八卦轶事，等等，来剖析星座与人的特质，让我们更好地了解自我，了解他人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>食用提示：打开星盘小程序或者App，配合节目食用，效果更佳！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 黄道十二宫第三个星座：超强的随机应变能力（比如，</span><strong><span>小S</span></strong><span>）；适合做狗仔，不适合做树洞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDekyZlKCY743_lL4yVniNu3psF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> 双子座的神话故事——</span><strong><span>永远年轻，永远游戏人间</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq4JU5_5brV87fWlTSjBhr7nAspi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 去体验你丰富的人生吧！（</span><strong><span>双子座在10宫-事业宫的听众可以尝试副业哦！</span></strong><span>）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Firw8QdRElRPUjH5B2Ovrgs4AUZU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 当双子落到不同行星和上升：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> 太阳双子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> 月亮双子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 水星双子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 金星双子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 火星双子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 上升双子</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a> 柯南·道尔（</span><strong><span>太阳双子、火星双子</span></strong><span>）：我能把冲突的世界观合二为一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2756">45:56</a> 费尔南多·佩索阿（</span><strong><span>太阳双子、水星双子</span></strong><span>）：我的内心住着无数个宇宙！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3918">01:05:18</a> 和双子座相处的诀窍：</span><strong><span>保持新鲜感、保持有趣！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4381">01:13:01</a> </span><strong><span>木星进入双子座</span></strong><span>……和我有什么关系？？？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4561">01:16:01</a> 找到双子座落在你星盘的哪个宫位！</span><strong><span>（1宫～12宫浅析）</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4984">01:23:04</a> 生活的答案不止A和B，挣脱自我的枷锁，拥抱变化！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>沙沙：《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》《也许你该找个人聊聊》《5%的改变》图书编辑、ISAR（国际占星研究协会）认证职业占星师、心理咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span>山猫：图书编辑、上海翻译家协会会员、北京大学文学学士、伦敦国王学院文学硕士</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr33jCz9n0zzOewOPYOxGwnv0iEF.m4a" length="88911155" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FodXko9ss4JXaNSKNs7JY8WIQlVv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人人都有金牛座：天然与优雅是我的天赋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66497d68251bd96e6c43f486</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66497d68251bd96e6c43f486</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 04:17:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是“星星眼”的第二期——金牛座，我们将从神话图景、文学作品、文化名人，甚至是文化圈的八卦轶事，等等，来剖析星座与人的特质，让我们更好地了解自我，了解他人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 黄道十二宫第二个星座的力量：行动起来，把白羊的冲劲落地</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUtnTCZK9ZutED7HTUqllavLOuX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 就算不是金牛座， 我的星盘里也可能有金牛：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 打开星盘软件，输入自</span><strong><span>出生地点和时间（具体到分钟）</span></strong><span>，获取自己的星盘！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 看看</span><strong><span>个人行星（日月水金火）和上升</span></strong><span>落在哪个星座</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 看看</span><strong><span>12个宫位</span></strong><span>的守护星分别是什么星座</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Firw8QdRElRPUjH5B2Ovrgs4AUZU.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 解读星盘就像连词成句——举例：</span><strong><span>3宫落到白羊座</span></strong><span>是什么意思呢？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> </span><strong><span>安全感、物欲、攻击力</span></strong><span>——金牛座的特质来自宙斯的三件礼物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2KKIix8Q693nrlwgGhqQ8N2BYe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 抠门只是想获得</span><strong><span>安全感</span></strong><span>——山猫遇到过最“奇葩”的金牛座！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 生活如此美好，金牛如此</span><strong><span>享受</span></strong><span>（张颂文老师也是金牛座哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> </span><strong><span>忍</span></strong><span>无可忍，无需再忍——不要反复试探金牛座的底线！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> </span><strong><span>个人行星（日月水金火）和上升</span></strong><span>落在金牛座，会有什么样的表现？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 太阳金牛：我认同脚踏实地、长期主义的价值观</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 金星金牛： 我有超高的鉴赏能力，和近乎苛刻审美需求</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 水星金牛：我语速不快、声音动听、语调婉转</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> 月亮金牛：我的内心宁静，被呵护和滋养</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 火星金牛：我发不出火，我追求和谐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 上升金牛：上升金牛出美女？（</span><strong><span>上升还会影响外貌！</span></strong><span>）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> </span><strong><span>巴尔扎克（日金牛、水金牛）</span></strong><span>的大生蚝、大羊排和大珠宝：我是不会亏待自己的！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 彭懿老师（金牛座）的写作习惯居然和巴尔扎克的如此相似？？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkM6xy1-uwCBqthpnuQ4D2wKXEwT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> </span><strong><span>康熙</span></strong><span>可以忍你20年：金牛座是不是都有自己记仇的小本本？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">01:00:06</a> 怎么跟金牛座相处？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">01:00:55</a> </span><strong><span>不要尝试改变金牛</span></strong><span>，让ta在自己的领域用自己的方法做事吧！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3869">01:04:29</a> 实在不行，你就</span><strong><span>用好吃的</span></strong><span>……哄哄ta吧！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3928">01:05:28</a> 和金牛座合得来的星座有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span>沙沙：《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》《也许你该找个人聊聊》《5%的改变》图书编辑、ISAR（国际占星研究协会）认证职业占星师、心理咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span>山猫：图书编辑、上海翻译家协会会员、北京大学文学学士、伦敦国王学院文学硕士</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltNGu0BI1oE3wdEs5IfHOPzu2c6Z.m4a" length="68871266" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIB-wHBOLgUJsTqSEw6SOYKGpEU.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人人都有白羊座：去过一往无前的人生吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6636468603bcdd73a9734c91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6636468603bcdd73a9734c91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 May 2024 14:30:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期是“星星眼”的第一期——白羊座，我们将从神话图景、文学作品、文化名人，甚至是文化圈的八卦轶事，等等，来剖析星座与人的特质，让我们更好地了解自我，了解他人。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 黄道十二宫第一个星座的力量：冲破寒冬、迎来暖春</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 读懂一个星座，就要读懂它的神话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLnyPP_gwYzqw70AaGMk88TXrXO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 为什么每个人的星盘里都有白羊座？？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>达·芬奇</span></strong><span>虽然不是白羊座（太阳白羊），但他的水星是白羊座哦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0lHVlTu6kmphLTSfNbGcb4XLmD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> </span><strong><span>梵高</span></strong><span>的斗争与执着：高阶白羊是利他群体的典型代表</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的重点行星：</span><strong><span>太阳白羊、月亮射手、水星白羊</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAupnhxP6bKZpLroi_p6JRQZd9-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> </span><strong><span>安徒生</span></strong><span>的纯真与热烈：白羊座真的是冲动“傻白甜”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的重点行星：</span><strong><span>太阳白羊、月亮金牛、水星白羊</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhT0hrJDJ-D_MIJU6cBuYG-Z-D8t.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3933">01:05:33</a> 寻找你身上的白羊气质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">01:09:20</a> 想要俘获白羊座芳心：</span><strong><span>请打直球！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>沙沙：《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》《也许你该找个人聊聊》《5%的改变》图书编辑、ISAR（国际占星研究协会）认证职业占星师、心理咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span>山猫：图书编辑、上海翻译家协会会员、北京大学文学学士、伦敦国王学院文学硕士</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loBwyIFd3Cy9naSsTf1PBHallCH2.m4a" length="67403100" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu45p8Y3em3AWvpAJ9pg9r4jt4dh.png"/>
